SDKs that can share a phone's internet connection, give remote support or record the screen, collected
by the Datapavan project and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0019.

sdks.tsv, sources.tsv
    Written by the project. Vendor names are given as each vendor publishes them.

signatures.tsv
    Written by update.py, which reads each identifier in the artefact it names (an SDK the vendor
    publishes) and records the artefact's SHA-256. Identifiers are names of code, which are facts about
    published files; the legal review before the first public release covers this list and its
    wording (ADR 0015, decision 12).

update.py
    The collector: Apache-2.0, like the rest of this repository.
